# AIVO Code Owners
#
# Code owners are automatically requested for review when a pull request
# touches the matching paths. The repository's branch protection rules
# may also require approval from owners before a PR can be merged.
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern takes precedence.
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-customizations/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Replace the placeholder team handles below with the real GitHub team
# slugs (e.g. @artpromedia/security, @artpromedia/platform). Until those
# teams exist, the @artpromedia/maintainers fallback ensures every PR
# still gets an owner.

